  "title": "Week 16: Agents",
  "date": "2025-04-18T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 16: Agents\n\nThis week is the Microsoft Reactor week. Actually the whole month is about AI. During this event, I learned a lot about AI agents, RAGs. And because the nextjs global hackathon. Right now, I have a lot free AI accounts to try, I have tried MCP on claude. It is not very surprised when it finished a simple job. I think it is just because I have used bolt and v0 before. But the money cost a lot, I guess it is because deepseek make the price down, so the MCP can work.\n\nI tried UE5 and bevy this week. My laptop hardly make UE5 to run, I have to tune down many preferences to use it. Right now UE5 does not officially support Web. Then I tried bevy, there is no editor for bevy, that means you have to imagine everything before it builds. And the building time is very long.",
